{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-011",
    "title": "：旧驿道"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_059",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临走到第三块碑前，发现灰泥下露出一个“归”字。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封山令持续到第七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1542,
          "end": 1542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这七日里，玄霄宗恢复了表面上的秩序。外门弟子照常修炼、吃饭、巡灯，西坡却始终挂着黑色封条。每到夜里，山门九盏灯便有一盏无故摇晃，第二天仍有人把它解释成山风。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1544,
          "end": 1544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有再去废井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1546,
          "end": 1546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是。旧档没有这张图。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1572,
          "end": 1572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它从哪里来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1574,
          "end": 1574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人把它放在我的案头。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1576,
          "end": 1576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叶观澜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1578,
          "end": 1578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有承认，也没有否认：“无灯镇不属于玄霄宗辖地。你若去那里，宗门不会保护你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1580,
          "end": 1580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲去过那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1582,
          "end": 1582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只知道他曾经被记录在西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1584,
          "end": 1584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在我知道三个人在无灯镇未归。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1586,
          "end": 1586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看着他，语气很轻：“知道得越多，能回头的路越少。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临收起地图：“我想知道剩下两个人是谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1590,
          "end": 1590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有阻拦。她从桌下取出一盏普通引路灯，递给他。灯芯完整，灯油清亮，灯罩内壁却刻着一道极浅的缺口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1592,
          "end": 1592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“带上它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1594,
          "end": 1594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1596,
          "end": 1596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“路上若有人问，就说是我准许你带走的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1598,
          "end": 1598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人问呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1600,
          "end": 1600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1602,
          "end": 1602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把灯收进包中。他正要离开，沈砚秋忽然叫住他：“陆沉舟不是叛徒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1604,
          "end": 1604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次替这个名字作出判断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他为什么失踪？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1608,
          "end": 1608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为他送的不是灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1610,
          "end": 1610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1612,
          "end": 1612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬头看向三盏长明灯：“一段不能被点亮的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1614,
          "end": 1614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有再解释。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1616,
          "end": 1616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走出登记堂时，顾长离正在台阶下等候。她背着一个旧布包，腰间铜针比平时多了两枚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1618,
          "end": 1618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也要下山？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1620,
          "end": 1620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要去无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1622,
          "end": 1622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为顾氏账本？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1624,
          "end": 1624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三年前离开的三名账房中，有一个是我叔父。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1626,
          "end": 1626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折好的路引递给他。路引上盖着顾氏旁支的印，日期正是冬至前七日。印章缺口与废井铜环完全一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1628,
          "end": 1628
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你什么时候知道的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1630,
          "end": 1630
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“昨晚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1632,
          "end": 1632
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁告诉你的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1634,
          "end": 1634
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“档房那个老者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1636,
          "end": 1636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起那双浑浊却清醒的眼睛。老者说过，档案若少了，就当它从来没有在这里。可他显然记得每一张被拿走的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1638,
          "end": 1638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "午时，山门铁闸升起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1640,
          "end": 1640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "大多数弟子留在宗内，只有几名外门修士带着任务下山。陆照临和顾长离没有走正门，而是沿渡桥下的旧水道前行。水道入口藏在一块坍塌石碑后，石壁上刻着送灯人的旧规矩：入水道者，不得回头数灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1642,
          "end": 1642
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "水道比想象中狭窄。两人只能侧身通行，脚下积水没过鞋底。每隔一段距离，石壁上便有一个凹槽，凹槽里原本应该放灯，如今只剩焦黑的痕迹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1644,
          "end": 1644
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临数到第七个凹槽时，顾长离突然停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1646,
          "end": 1646
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别数。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1648,
          "end": 1648
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只是在记位置。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1650,
          "end": 1650
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就记位置，不要数。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1652,
          "end": 1652
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她指向前方。水面上漂着一盏小灯，灯火未点，却随着水流逆向移动。灯柄上缠着黑色铜丝，和陆沉舟的断灯杆相同。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1654,
          "end": 1654
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手去捞，顾长离按住他的手。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1656,
          "end": 1656
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让它自己走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1658,
          "end": 1658
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "小灯沿水道漂出十几丈，在一道石门前停住。石门没有门缝，门面却有半枚青白色印记。陆照临掌心的残印随之发热，门后的黑暗里传来轻轻的敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1660,
          "end": 1660
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1662,
          "end": 1662
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1664,
          "end": 1664
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“害怕。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1685,
          "end": 1685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“要。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1689,
          "end": 1689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暂时没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1731,
          "end": 1731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1733,
          "end": 1733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离指向坡下。泥地上有一排新脚印，脚印从远处来，到荒坡便折向东侧，没有靠近水道出口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1735,
          "end": 1735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们在找正路。”她说，“我们走偏了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1737,
          "end": 1737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "荒坡下是一条被废弃的石路。路面长满苔藓，石缝中开着细小的黄花。路边立着半截木柱，柱上残留着驿站的旧标记：一盏没有灯芯的灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1739,
          "end": 1739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临取出沈砚秋给的普通引路灯。灯罩内壁的缺口与木柱上的标记完全一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1741,
          "end": 1741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她知道这条路。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1743,
          "end": 1743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她说地图是别人放在案头的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1745,
          "end": 1745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她没有说是谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1747,
          "end": 1747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也没有阻止我们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1749,
          "end": 1749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看他一眼：“她若真想阻止，昨晚就该把你留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1751,
          "end": 1751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两人沿石路向东。路旁每隔一里便有一块倒下的界碑，碑面刻着州郡名称，却都被人用灰泥涂过。陆照临走到第三块碑前，发现灰泥下露出一个“归”字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1753,
          "end": 1753
        }
      }
    ],
